<title>USA: Personnel Group buys Word Processing.</title>
<headline>Personnel Group buys Word Processing.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Personnel Group of America Inc said on Monday it has acquired Word Processing Professionals Inc.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Word Processing is a clerical staffing company providing temporary word processing and desktop publishing services in New York City.  Its 1996 revenues were about $6 million, Personnel Group said.</p>
